 private LinearLayout device(String name){LinearLayout box=vertical();box.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER);RelayIcon icon=new RelayIcon(this,"phone",ink);box.addView(icon,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(dp(34),dp(44)));TextView title=label(name,16,ink);title.setTypeface(null,Typeface.BOLD);title.setPadding(0,dp(8),0,dp(5));box.addView(title);return box;}
 private void renderConnection(){if(connectionTitle==null)return;boolean paired=credentials.flag("nativePaired",false),ready=NativeBridge.ready();connectionTitle.setText(ready?"iPhone과 연결됨":!credentials.flag("nativeMode",false)?"iPhone과 연결하세요":NativeBridge.connectionState());connectionTitle.setTextColor(ink);connectionProgress.setVisibility(NativeBridge.connecting()?View.VISIBLE:View.GONE);String detail=ready?"블루투스로 안전하게 알림을 전달하고 있어요.":paired?"iPhone의 Relay를 열고 두 기기를 가까이 두세요.":"iPhone Relay에서 Galaxy의 QR을 스캔하세요.";String sync=credentials.get("lastSync","");try{if(!sync.isEmpty())detail+="\n마지막 전송 · "+android.text.format.DateUtils.getRelativeTimeSpanString(Long.parseLong(sync),System.currentTimeMillis(),60000);}catch(Exception ignored){}connectionDetail.setText(detail);connectionAction.setText(paired?ready?"연결 상태 확인":"연결 다시 시작":"QR로 iPhone 연결");connectionAction.setOnClickListener(v->{if(ready)status.setText("iPhone과 블루투스로 연결되어 있습니다.");else if(paired)NativeUi.connect(this);else NativeUi.show(this);});repairAction.setVisibility(paired?View.VISIBLE:View.GONE);galaxyBattery.setText(DeviceBattery.current().label());iphoneBattery.setText(DeviceBattery.peerLabel(this));locationPermission.setText(LocationUi.permission(this));locationDetail.setText(DisconnectLocation.description(this));mapAction.setVisibility(DisconnectLocation.hasRecord(this)?View.VISIBLE:View.GONE);permissionSummary.setText((RelayNotificationListener.current!=null?"✓ 알림 접근 허용":"알림 접근 필요")+"   ·   "+(NativeUi.allowed(this)?"✓ 근처 기기 허용":"근처 기기 권한 필요"));}
 private void buildSettings(){text("필요한 기능만 켜두세요.",14);FeatureUi.add(this);LinearLayout parent=section("서버 및 이전 PWA",credentials.secret("token").isEmpty());text("최초 등록 또는 이전 PWA 사용자용 설정입니다.",13);buildLegacy();root=parent;text("Galaxy Relay · "+BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME,12);}
 private void buildLegacy(){
 EncryptionUi.add(this);
 button("이전 PWA 연결 및 서버 등록 해제",()->new AlertDialog.Builder(this).setTitle("연결을 해제할까요?").setMessage("양쪽 인증 토큰이 폐기됩니다. 다시 연결하려면 Backend 등록부터 시작하세요.").setNegativeButton("취소",null).setPositiveButton("연결 해제",(d,w)->execute(()->{new RelayApi(this).call("/api/unpair",new JSONObject(),true);try{com.google.android.gms.tasks.Tasks.await(FirebaseMessaging.getInstance().deleteToken(),15,java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit.SECONDS);}catch(Exception ignored){}credentials.clear();RelayDatabase.get(this).dao().clearEvents();RelayDatabase.get(this).dao().clearCommands();return "연결 해제 완료";})).show());

        EditText backend=new EditText(this);backend.setTextColor(ink);backend.setHintTextColor(muted);backend.setHint("https://relay.example.com");backend.setInputType(17);backend.setText(credentials.get("backend",""));root.addView(backend);
        EditText secret=new EditText(this);secret.setTextColor(ink);secret.setHintTextColor(muted);secret.setHint("설치 비밀값 (INSTALL_SECRET)");secret.setInputType(129);root.addView(secret);
        button("Backend 등록",()->{if(registering)return;if(!credentials.secret("token").isEmpty()){status.setText("이미 등록됐습니다. 새 등록은 연결 해제 후 진행하세요.");return;}final String install=secret.getText().toString();registering=true;credentials.put("backend",backend.getText().toString().trim());try{FirebaseMessaging.getInstance().getToken().addOnSuccessListener(token->execute(()->{try{JSONObject result=new RelayApi(this).call("/api/android/register",new JSONObject().put("name",android.os.Build.MODEL).put("installSecret",install).put("fcmToken",token),false);credentials.secret("token",result.getString("token"));credentials.secret("commandKey",result.getString("commandKey"));credentials.secret("fcm",token);credentials.put("deviceId",result.getString("deviceId"));runOnUiThread(()->secret.setText(""));return "Backend 등록 완료";}finally{registering=false;}})).addOnFailureListener(e->{registering=false;status.setText("Firebase 설정을 확인해주세요.");});}catch(Exception e){registering=false;status.setText("google-services.json을 설정하고 다시 빌드해주세요.");}});
        button("연결 상태 확인",this::refresh);
        button("iPhone 연결 코드 생성",()->execute(()->{JSONObject r=new RelayApi(this).call("/api/pair/create",new JSONObject(),true);return "연결 코드: "+r.getString("code")+"\n5분 후 만료. iPhone에서 입력한 뒤 연결 상태를 확인하세요.";}));
        button("테스트 이벤트 보내기",()->execute(()->{JSONObject e=new JSONObject().put("id","evt_"+UUID.randomUUID()).put("type","notification").put("app","Galaxy Relay 테스트").put("title","연결 테스트").put("body","Galaxy에서 보낸 테스트 알림입니다.").put("timestamp",System.currentTimeMillis());if(credentials.flag("nativeMode",false)){RelayQueue.store(this,e,"",false);RelayQueue.kick(this,0);return "네이티브 테스트 알림을 전송 Queue에 넣었습니다.";}new RelayApi(this).call("/api/event",new JSONObject().put("event",EventCipher.protect(this,e)),true);return "테스트 Push 전달 요청 완료";}));

 }
 private void loadHistory(){if(history==null)return;final int ticket=++historyGeneration;io.execute(()->{ArrayList<JSONObject> values=new ArrayList<>();try{for(EventRecord r:RelayDatabase.get(this).dao().recent()){try{JSONObject e=new JSONObject(credentials.open(r.data));if(e.optString("type").equals("removed")||e.optString("type").equals("command_result"))continue;e.put("localPending",r.pending);values.add(e);}catch(Exception ignored){}}}catch(Exception ignored){}runOnUiThread(()->{if(isDestroyed()||ticket!=historyGeneration)return;LinearLayout saved=root;root=history;history.removeAllViews();text("최근 전달한 알림 · "+values.size()+"개",14);if(values.isEmpty()){LinearLayout parent=card("아직 알림이 없어요","Galaxy에 새 알림이 오면 이곳에 전달 기록이 표시됩니다.");row("테스트 알림 보내기","연결 상태를 확인해보세요.",this::testEvent);root=parent;}for(JSONObject e:values){LinearLayout parent=card("",null);String app=e.optString("app",e.optString("type","앱"));LinearLayout head=new LinearLayout(this);head.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER_VERTICAL);ImageView icon=new ImageView(this);try{icon.setImageDrawable(getPackageManager().getApplicationIcon(e.optString("packageName")));}catch(Exception ignored){icon.setImageResource(R.drawable.ic_relay);}head.addView(icon,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(dp(34),dp(34)));TextView name=label(app,14,accent);name.setPadding(dp(10),0,0,0);head.addView(name,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(0,-2,1));TextView time=label(android.text.format.DateFormat.format("HH:mm",e.optLong("timestamp")).toString(),12,muted);head.addView(time);root.addView(head);TextView title=text(credentials.flag("privacy",true)?"알림 내용 숨김":e.optString("title",app),17);title.setTextColor(ink);title.setTypeface(null,Typeface.BOLD);text(e.optBoolean("localPending")?"전송 대기 중":"전달 기록 · 눌러서 자세히 보기",12);root.setBackground(touch(surface,26));root.setOnClickListener(v->showEvent(e));root.setFocusable(true);root=parent;}root=saved;});});}
 private void showEvent(JSONObject e){new AlertDialog.Builder(this).setTitle(e.optString("app","알림")).setMessage(e.optString("title")+"\n\n"+e.optString("body")+"\n\n"+android.text.format.DateFormat.format("M월 d일 HH:mm",e.optLong("timestamp"))).setPositiveButton("닫기",null).show();}
 void testEvent(){execute(()->{JSONObject e=new JSONObject().put("id","evt_"+UUID.randomUUID()).put("type","notification").put("app","Galaxy Relay 테스트").put("title","연결 테스트").put("body","Galaxy에서 보낸 테스트 알림입니다.").put("timestamp",System.currentTimeMillis());RelayQueue.store(this,e,"",false);RelayQueue.kick(this,0);return "테스트 알림을 전송 대기열에 넣었습니다.";});}
 protected void addFeatures(){FeatureUi.add(this);}
 @Override protected void onResume(){super.onResume();DeviceBattery.refresh(this);DisconnectLocation.load(this);visible=false;liveHandler.removeCallbacks(liveUpdate);liveHandler.post(liveUpdate);loadHistory();if(RelayNotificationListener.current==null)android.service.notification.NotificationListenerService.requestRebind(new android.content.ComponentName(this,RelayNotificationListener.class));if(credentials.flag("nativeMode",false)&&NativeUi.allowed(this))startForegroundService(new android.content.Intent(this,NativeBridge.class));RelayQueue.kick(this,0);}
 @Override public void onWindowFocusChanged(boolean focused){super.onWindowFocusChanged(focused);visible=focused;}
 @Override protected void onPause(){visible=false;liveHandler.removeCallbacks(liveUpdate);super.onPause();}
 @Override protected void onSaveInstanceState(Bundle out){out.putInt("tab",selected);super.onSaveInstanceState(out);}
    protected void refresh(){execute(()->{JSONObject r=new RelayApi(this).call("/api/status",null,true);String id=r.optString("pendingId","");if(!id.isEmpty()&&!id.equals("null")){runOnUiThread(()->new AlertDialog.Builder(this).setTitle("iPhone 연결 승인").setMessage("iPhone에 표시된 승인 코드와 비교하세요: "+r.optString("approvalCode")+"\n일치할 때만 승인하세요.").setNegativeButton("취소",null).setPositiveButton("코드 일치 · 승인",(d,w)->execute(()->{new RelayApi(this).call("/api/pair/approve",new JSONObject().put("webId",id),true);return "iPhone 연결 완료";})).show());}return (r.optBoolean("paired")?"● iPhone 연결됨":"○ 연결 대기")+"\nBackend 정상";});}

 @Override protected void onDestroy(){liveHandler.removeCallbacksAndMessages(null);super.onDestroy();io.shutdown();}
